        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Can I tell you something I haven't said out loud before?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "always"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "When you asked on Saturday if I was seeing anyone in Seattle, I said not really. That's true now. But there was someone for three years."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Her name was Joanne. My parents never met her. They don't know she existed."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I've never told my parents about anyone."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "oh hana"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "thank you for telling me"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "you don't owe them that. or me. you know that right"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I know it in my head."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Mom asked at dinner if I'd 'met a nice man in Seattle.' I said I was busy with work. Then I went to the bathroom and texted you."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "i'm glad you texted me"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m12",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "for the record i'm very out and my abuela still asks if i've met a nice man. she's 91, she's allowed"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m13",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Was it hard? With your family?"
        },
        {
